@startuml 12-component-diagram
title Component Diagram Konseptual - Sistem Informasi Puskeswan
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Lapisan Presentasi (Aplikasi Web / UI)" {
  [Antarmuka Admin & Dokter] as UI_Internal
  [Guest Site (Artikel & Staf Publik)] as UI_Public
  [Dashboard Pengelola (Super Admin)] as COMP_DASH
}

package "Lapisan Keamanan & Manajemen Pengguna" {
  [Autentikasi Role & Passkey WebAuthn] as COMP_AUTH
  [Manajemen Akun Petugas & Staf] as COMP_USER
}

package "Lapisan Modul Pelayanan & Klinis" {
  [Modul Pendaftaran & Autofill Pasien] as COMP_ADMIN_MODUL
  [Modul Kunjungan & Antrean Harian] as COMP_RM_VISIT
  [Modul Pemeriksaan Medis (Dokter)] as COMP_EXAM
  [Modul Surveilans Kasus Rabies (GHPR)] as COMP_RABIES
}

package "Lapisan Modul Master Data" {
  [Master Data Jenis Hewan (Dropdown)] as COMP_MD_JENIS
  [Master Data Obat & Bahan Medis] as COMP_MD_OBAT
}

package "Lapisan Modul Pendukung & Manajerial" {
  [Manajemen Kategori & Artikel Edukasi] as COMP_ARTICLE
  [Manajemen Data Tenaga Staf] as COMP_STAFF
  [Inventaris Peralatan Puskeswan] as COMP_INV
  [Modul Laporan & Cetak PDF Multi-Filter] as COMP_REPORT
  [Modul Chat Internal & Notifikasi Realtime] as COMP_CHAT
}

package "Lapisan Basis Data Konseptual (Relational Database)" {
  database "Penyimpanan Database Terpadu\n(15 Tabel Sesuai ERD)" as COMP_DB
}

' Hubungan Antarkomponen
UI_Internal --> COMP_AUTH : verifikasi login, role & passkey
UI_Internal --> COMP_CHAT : komunikasi staf (floating chat)
UI_Internal --> COMP_RABIES : input kasus rabies & cetak surat
UI_Public --> COMP_ARTICLE : menampilkan berita & artikel edukasi
UI_Public --> COMP_STAFF : menampilkan profil tenaga staf publik

COMP_DASH --> COMP_USER
COMP_DASH --> COMP_ADMIN_MODUL
COMP_DASH --> COMP_RM_VISIT
COMP_DASH --> COMP_EXAM
COMP_DASH --> COMP_RABIES
COMP_DASH --> COMP_MD_JENIS
COMP_DASH --> COMP_MD_OBAT
COMP_DASH --> COMP_ARTICLE
COMP_DASH --> COMP_STAFF
COMP_DASH --> COMP_INV
COMP_DASH --> COMP_REPORT

COMP_ADMIN_MODUL --> COMP_MD_JENIS : referensi jenis hewan (dropdown)
COMP_RM_VISIT --> COMP_ADMIN_MODUL : menggunakan data autofill (NIK & RM0001)
COMP_EXAM --> COMP_RM_VISIT : mengaitkan rekam medis ke kunjungan (1:1)
COMP_EXAM --> COMP_MD_OBAT : referensi terapi obat
COMP_RABIES --> COMP_MD_JENIS : referensi jenis hewan penggigit

COMP_REPORT --> COMP_RM_VISIT : rekap kunjungan & status selesai
COMP_REPORT --> COMP_EXAM : rekap diagnosa medis & terapi
COMP_REPORT --> COMP_RABIES : rekap data kasus gigitan rabies

COMP_AUTH --> COMP_DB : tabel roles, users, passkeys
COMP_USER --> COMP_DB : tabel users, staff
COMP_ADMIN_MODUL --> COMP_DB : tabel owners, animals, animal_types
COMP_RM_VISIT --> COMP_DB : tabel visits
COMP_EXAM --> COMP_DB : tabel examinations
COMP_MD_JENIS --> COMP_DB : tabel animal_types
COMP_MD_OBAT --> COMP_DB : tabel medicines
COMP_ARTICLE --> COMP_DB : tabel categories, articles
COMP_STAFF --> COMP_DB : tabel staff
COMP_INV --> COMP_DB : tabel inventories
COMP_RABIES --> COMP_DB : tabel rabies_cases
COMP_CHAT --> COMP_DB : tabel chat_messages
COMP_REPORT --> COMP_DB : query relasi data

note right of UI_Internal
  **Catatan Arsitektur Modul:**
  - Hanya diakses oleh Super Admin, Admin, dan Dokter.
  - Pasien (pemilik hewan) berinteraksi secara fisik
    melalui Admin dan Dokter di klinik.
end note

@enduml
